      "committedDate": "2026-07-29T00:05:32Z",
      "messageBody": "Implements DMX-DCP-MODEL-ROUTING-MVP-0007I. Introduces non-serializable\nTrustedInputCapability and fail-closed is_execution_eligible gate with\nzero active adapters. No mutation adapter enabled; no runner/MCP/live\nexecution surface. Residual RouteDecision.is_runnable forge path remains\nout of allowlist for 0007T/0007A.",
